---
import Content from '../layouts/Content.astro';
import {company,site,compute} from '../data/site';
import {team} from '../data/team';
---
<Content title={`About ${company.full} — our company and team`} description={`${company.entity}, operating under ${company.holdingCompany}, develops AI infrastructure in Mead, Oklahoma. Meet the SmartTec leadership and advisory team.`} kicker="Company / People / Purpose" heading="The people behind the infrastructure." lede={`SmartTec brings data-center services and energy expertise together on a ${site.acres}-acre campus in Mead, Oklahoma. Our first deployment combines dedicated RTX and B300 compute with space for customer-owned equipment.`} meta={[
  {label:'Company',value:company.entity,note:`Operating under ${company.holdingCompany}`},
  {label:'Parent company',value:company.parent,note:'Battery production and energy expertise'},
  {label:'Campus',value:`${site.acres} acres`,note:site.name},
  {label:'First deployment',value:compute.phaseSystems,note:'Planned · colocation in Buildings A and C'},
]}>
  <section aria-labelledby="what" data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__n">01</span><span class="eyebrow__t">Our focus</span></p>
    <h2 id="what">A practical starting point for AI infrastructure</h2>
    <div class="split"><p>SmartTec is developing its first campus at {site.address}. Buildings A and C provide {site.dataCenterArea.toLocaleString()} sq ft of gross building area for data-center development. Building B supports batteries, utilities and storage. The initial compute plan is {compute.phaseSystems}.</p><p>We work with organizations seeking dedicated compute and customers bringing their own hardware. Each deployment starts with workload, power, cooling and connectivity requirements, followed by an agreed installation and service plan. First service is targeted for Q4 2026, following fit-out and commissioning.</p></div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="parentage" data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__n">02</span><span class="eyebrow__t">Energy and compute</span></p>
    <h2 id="parentage">Connected by a shared campus plan</h2>
    <p>{company.entity} operates under {company.holdingCompany}. {company.parent} is the parent company and battery producer. Its energy expertise connects SmartTec's compute deployment with the longer-term battery, solar and manufacturing plan.</p>
    <div class="cards"><article class="card"><h3>Data-center services</h3><p>Dedicated RTX and B300 compute, plus customer-owned colocation in Buildings A and C.</p><a href="/compute">Explore the compute plan →</a></article><article class="card"><h3>Energy infrastructure</h3><p>An on-site OG&E transformer, planned Z1Power storage and a two-loop cooling concept for the data-center buildings.</p><a href="/power">See power and cooling →</a></article><article class="card"><h3>Campus development</h3><p>Existing buildings anchor the first phase. Planned inverter and battery assembly, solar and storage provide room for future development.</p><a href="/site">Explore Site 01 →</a></article></div>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="people" data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__n">03</span><span class="eyebrow__t">Our team</span></p>
    <h2 id="people">Leadership, operations and advisors</h2>
    <p>The people leading SmartTec's business, technology, operations and supporting functions.</p>
    <div class="team-grid">{team.map(person=><article class="team-card"><span class="team-monogram" aria-hidden="true">{person.initials}</span><div><h3>{person.name}</h3><p>{person.role}</p></div></article>)}</div>
  </section>
  <section class="is-end" aria-labelledby="talk" data-reveal>
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow__n">04</span><span class="eyebrow__t">Start a conversation</span></p>
    <h2 id="talk">Bring us the workload you want to run</h2>
    <p>Contact Yasir at <a href="mailto:yasir@futonix.com">yasir@futonix.com</a> to discuss your deployment, arrange a site visit or connect with the team.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact">Talk to SmartTec</a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/site">Visit the campus plan</a></div>
  </section>
</Content>
<style>
.team-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px;margin-top:32px}.team-card{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;padding:26px 22px;border:1px solid #c7e8d52b;border-radius:10px;background:#173d2f66;min-width:0}.team-monogram{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 54px;height:54px;border:1px solid #7be88a50;background:#7be88a0b;color:#9cf0a8;border-radius:50%;font:17px var(--f-mono)}.team-card h3{font-size:19px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.team-card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin:0;color:#b9cdc0}.team-card div{min-width:0}@media(max-width:1050px){.team-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}}@media(max-width:620px){.team-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.team-card{padding:22px}.team-card h3{font-size:19px}}
</style>
